  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Beacon Light - Homo Rainbow**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Stella Blue**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Mononucleosis - Squelch The Weasel - She Fucks Me**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **You Fucked Up - Hot For Teacher**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **She Caught My Fancy**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **banter - it's all good**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **These Eyes - The Blarney Stone**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **IWTLYP**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween1999-08-04** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 174 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- This was the second night of Ween's two-night stand at The Pier; the first night is posted separately on the archive [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween1999-08-04**: taped by gilde; transferred by gilde; source: Schoeps MK-4 capsules > Active collette cables > Custom pre-amp / power supply > Sony SBM-1 A/D converter > DAT [1]. Also: Tracks were tagged and renamed in October 2017 by someone credited as morst; files are FLAC, originally from CDR WAVE [1]",
